+
+# Fix cancel refund policy
+
+Review finding: `cancel` refunded in full whenever `at` was before the start, contradicting task-001's
+policy (none under 24 h before start, else full). task-005 wrongly called its policy an assumption.
+
+Fix: the refund is the whole total when `at` is at least 24 h before the booking starts, nothing from
+24 h before the start on. Changed in `src/index.ts`, covered by tests in `test/rental.test.ts`;
+task-005's policy note corrected to point to task-001.
